# Observe an already-running two-Brick Mario Kart session without sending input.
# Mario Kart reports a join failure explicitly ("An error has occurred.") and
# shows a racer count on the host, so it reads more clearly than Asphalt.
SESSION mariokart-observe-{date}-{time} devbridge-sessions
CONNECT_ADB 1c000c66050607724dd host
CONNECT_ADB 2c000c81b5c4078245d client
all:SCREEN settled
WAIT 20000
all:SCREEN twenty-seconds
STATUS
